      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "class IntervalTimer::Adder {\npublic:\n    Adder () = delete;\n    Adder (Adder&& src);\n    Adder (const Function<void (void)>& f, const Time::Duration& repeatInterval, const optional<Time::Duration>& hysteresis = nullopt);\n    Adder (IntervalTimer::Manager& manager, const Function<void (void)>& f, const Time::Duration& repeatInterval, const optional<Time::Duration>& hysteresis = nullopt);\n    \n    OFTEN handy to have flag saying not just run after the repeatInterval, but flag saying if you run immediately first time or not. Its about 50-50 that you want this (maybe more that you want).\n    \n    Oversite that no flag available.\n    ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "codeBlock"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
